{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46143","headline":"灞陵战叟 · 贯休","name":"灞陵战叟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"剑刓秋水鬓梳霜，回首胡天与恨长。\n官竟不封右校尉，鬬曾生挟左贤王。\n寻班超传空垂泪，读李陵书更断肠。\n今日灞陵陵畔见，春风花雾共茫茫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46143.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46143","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}